  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Complete small furry gliding mammal, membrane visibly linking forelimb/body/hindlimb on each side, long slender tail. Not bat, flying squirrel copy or flat fossil plaque. [\"IVPP V14739 is compressed with incomplete counterpart; complete membrane attachment contours and living body depth reconstructed.\", \"Hair impressions are real, but modeled coat color, ear outline, pose and tail-tip contour are uncertain.\", \"Do not claim articulated intact skull; original Figure1d is skull reconstruction.\", \"Original2006 age range disputed; later IVPP2017 source places it in Jurassic Yanliao biota. Do not repeat obsolete exact130Ma.\", \"Hindlimb-to-tail membrane extent is not fixed by the available figure; if used keep modest and explicitly inferred, never cover entire tail as colugo sheet.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"measured_jaw_length_m\": 0.0283, \"estimated_skull_length_m\": 0.035, \"estimated_head_body_length_m\": 0.13, \"source_range_headbody_m\": [0.12, 0.14], \"tail_length_m\": 0.14, \"tail_status\": \"Model estimate; long flattened caudal anatomy supported, exact complete length not measured here.\", \"spread_forelimb_span_m\": 0.17, \"spread_status\": \"Reconstruction choice, not direct specimen measurement.\", \"span_tolerance_m\": 0.01, \"note\": \"17 cm is approximate restored span; claw-tip span is measured separately in QA, not presented as fossil measurement.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Complete small furry gliding mammal, membrane visibly linking forelimb/body/hindlimb on each side, long slender tail. Not bat, flying squirrel copy or flat fossil plaque. [\"IVPP V14739 is compressed with incomplete counterpart; complete membrane attachment contours and living body depth reconstructed.\", \"Hair impressions are real, but modeled coat color, ear outline, pose and tail-tip contour are uncertain.\", \"Do not claim articulated intact skull; original Figure1d is skull reconstruction.\", \"Original2006 age range disputed; later IVPP2017 source places it in Jurassic Yanliao biota. Do not repeat obsolete exact130Ma.\", \"Hindlimb-to-tail membrane extent is not fixed by the available figure; if used keep modest and explicitly inferred, never cover entire tail as colugo sheet.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"measured_jaw_length_m\": 0.0283, \"estimated_skull_length_m\": 0.035, \"estimated_head_body_length_m\": 0.13, \"source_range_headbody_m\": [0.12, 0.14], \"tail_length_m\": 0.14, \"tail_status\": \"Model estimate; long flattened caudal anatomy supported, exact complete length not measured here.\", \"spread_forelimb_span_m\": 0.17, \"spread_status\": \"Reconstruction choice, not direct specimen measurement.\", \"span_tolerance_m\": 0.01, \"note\": \"17 cm is approximate restored span; claw-tip span is measured separately in QA, not presented as fossil measurement.\"}"
  },
